== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From ''[[tuttugu]]'' meaning "[[twenty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[fimm]]'' "[[five]]". Meaning '''twenty and five'''.
=== Cardinal number ===

'''tuttugu og sex'''

# [[twenty-six]], cardinal number after [[tuttugu og fimm]] and before [[tuttugu og sjö]]

